   }
  ],
  "enable": null,
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Intac serial settings: Modbus RTU, 38400 baud, no parity, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit; Node-ID 1-255, unique per controller.",
   "S0-S2 DIP switches select the ProtoNode profile (BACnet MS/TP, BACnet IP, N2...).",
   "BACnet MS/TP MAC address 1-127 on the A-bank DIP switches; baud rate on its own DIP bank.",
   "Device instance = Node_Offset (default 50,000, set in the web configurator) + A-bank value."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Many AV objects are configuration settings; avoid writing them cyclically."
  ]
 },
